  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN: Amplifying Women Peace and Security Actions in ASEAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Practice and Governance of Women, Peace and Security (WPS) in ASEAN&#xa0;will focus on embedding the principles of good governance to improve outcomes for women and girls in all their diversity, and fostering transparent, accountable, participatory and effective governance, through strengthening WPS accountability and capacity across the ASEAN region to support the effective realization of the ASEAN Regional Plan of Action on WPS.</narrative>
  </description>
